        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>队干培训记录</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #fff;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 18px 22px 30px 22px;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    color: #1a1a3a;\n    max-width: 560px;\n  }\n  h1.doc-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n    font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  table.record {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  table.record th,\n  table.record td {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 3px 4px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  .hdr-label {\n    text-align: center;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    width: 1%;\n  }\n  .hdr-fill {\n    text-align: center;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .side-label {\n    width: 26px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n  }\n  .content-cell {\n    height: 108px;\n    line-height: 2.1;\n    padding: 6px 8px;\n  }\n  .content-cell.tall {\n    height: 130px;\n  }\n  .content-cell p {\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n    text-indent: 8px;\n  }\n  .content-cell p.indent-more {\n    text-indent: 26px;\n  }\n  .handwrite {\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive, serif;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1 class=\"doc-title\">队 干 培 训 记 录</h1>\n\n<!-- Record 1 -->\n<table class=\"record\">\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"side-label\" rowspan=\"2\" style=\"border-right:1px solid #333;\"></td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">时间</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-fill handwrite\">9.3</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">负责人</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-fill handwrite\">李锦泽</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">参加人数</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-fill handwrite\">11</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">占队干总数比例</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-fill handwrite\">100%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"content-cell handwrite\" colspan=\"8\">\n      <p>1.明确工作职责，细化工作分工，</p>\n      <p>2. 制定工作设想及计划，</p>\n      <p>3. 各队干装就职讲话，</p>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<!-- Record 2 -->\n<table class=\"record\">\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"side-label\" rowspan=\"2\">内<br>容<br>及<br>形<br>式</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">时间</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-fill handwrite\">10.9</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">负责人</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-fill handwrite\">张逸涵</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">参加人数</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-fill handwrite\">11</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">占队干总数比例</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-fill handwrite\">100%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"content-cell handwrite\" colspan=\"8\">\n      <p>1.讨论班级的奖罚条例，</p>\n      <p>2. 讨论如何实行奖罚制度，</p>\n      <p>3. 讨论平时管理学生时要注意什么，</p>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<!-- Record 3 -->\n<table class=\"record\">\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"side-label\" rowspan=\"2\">内<br>容<br>及<br>形<br>式</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">时间</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-fill handwrite\">11.3</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">负责人</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-fill handwrite\">付景玲</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">参加人数</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-fill handwrite\">11</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">占队干总数比例</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-fill handwrite\">100%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"content-cell tall handwrite\" colspan=\"8\">\n      <p>1.讨论如何保持教室卫生，如何落实光盘行动，</p>\n      <p>2.班干部要做好详细的记录</p>\n      <p>3.班干部要做到以身作则</p>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<!-- Record 4 -->\n<table class=\"record\">\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"side-label\" rowspan=\"2\">内<br>容<br>及<br>形<br>式</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">时间</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-fill handwrite\">12.15</td>\n    <td class=\"hdr-label\">负责人</td>\n 